      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:01</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">But in Camp Grant they had National Guard personnel—personnel that were working there, giving us our clothes, our haircuts, whatever we needed. All the buttons were cut off, and all the, you know, what they would call identification marks from what Army you were in were pulled off. Well, when you got in there, you had to use the money you had to—</div>
