      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">03:15</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">—sign up, and then they give you the clothes. But they tell you where to go to change clothes, and over there, there was personnel from the National Guard directing. As they directed you, they told you how much money you should have.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">03:42</div>
