      <div class="timestamp">04:13</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">By the time they finished with you, you were broke. Well, they told you to bring some money. I brought, I think, about twenty dollars, and that was all gone. They charged you for everything they did. You were in the Army; they were supposed to do it. But this is the National Guard, and they were making money on me.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
