      <div class="timestamp">05:47</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">I told my dad [unclear] what I did. They had nothing to say about it, &#x27;cause they knew what the Army was doing at the time. I told them [unclear]. I suppose that&#x27;s the only way I could get it fast. I wanted to see them once before I got shipped out.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">06:16</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So after that, I got my three-day pass, and I went back. I didn&#x27;t know the roads around here or nothing. Had a hard time. But I had an identification card from the Army directing me [unclear].</div>
