      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">12:55</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So we had no beef to buy. You know, so in Europe they raised lambs and chickens and</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
